(n)
to perform functions designated by the State Government in the areas of urban renewal, environment and ecology,
transport and communication, water energy resource management directly or through its Functional Boards or other
departments/agencies as the State Government may specify;

(iv)
preservation of objects, features, structures or places of historical, natural, architectural or scientific interest and
educational value;
(v)
prevention of erosion, provision for afforestation or reforestation, improvement of water front areas, rivers, nallahs, lakes
and tanks;
(vi)
irrigation, water supply and hydroelectric works, flood control and prevention of water and air pollution;
(vii)
educational and medical facilities;
(viii)
district business centres, other shopping complexes, export oriented industrial areas and clearing houses, permanent
